&lt;p&gt;This dataset contains metabolomics data from samples collected from patients with Age-Related Macular Degeneration (AMD) and control participants. The data includes processed metabolomic measurements, clinical data, and genetic risk scores (GRS) for each sample, as well as allele scores for 52 single nucleotide polymorphisms (SNPs) associated with AMD.&lt;/p&gt;

